        "en": "Quraysh broke the Treaty of Hudaybiyyah; he ﷺ marched on Makkah with ten thousand, entered it, granted its people safety and cleansed the House of its idols. Then Surat al-Nasr was revealed, and his answer was glorification and seeking forgiveness."
