        "en": "He ﷺ marched on Khaybar after al-Hudaybiyah and besieged it until hunger struck them; then he gave the banner to 'Ali, charging him to begin with the call to Islam, and Allah granted victory at his hands. Afterwards a poisoned sheep was given to him, and he pardoned the woman who gave it."
