        "en": "He ﷺ set out for Tabuk in the hour of hardship and fierce heat, hurried past the dwellings of Thamud, and the spring of Tabuk flowed for him. On his return Ka'b ibn Malik and his two companions told the truth, and were shunned for fifty nights until their repentance was revealed."
